{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/14/8134984/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都個別ありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの握手会で、\n昇格後初の握手会で、\n幸せいっぱいでした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう言うために\nわざわざ来てくれた方もありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が来てくれていたので、\n地方部数増えないかなあ～...(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/14/8134984/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眩しくて顔険しい(′ʘ⌄ʘ‵)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋服まだ全然買えてなくて\n絶賛夏服！ラフ服！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログでも登場したことある服かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しくヒールを履いてみたのに\n誰1人として気付いてくれず、\n当分履かないかなあ～っ(′ʘ⌄ʘ‵)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"腕にね、擦り傷があったから\n隠すために妖怪ウォッチの\n絆創膏を貼っていたら、\nかなりの人に気付かれたよ(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも私全然詳しくないから\nわからなかった！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コマさんとコマじろう？の\n絆創膏貼ってたよっ！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/09/14/8134984/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々さんと同じ髪型だった～っ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https